{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（6日）上午9時半左右，警方接報一輛載有犯人的懲教署囚車，沿油麻地中九龍繞道駛往觀塘方向時爆胎，車上兩名犯人受輕傷。</p><p>人員到場後，救護車將兩人送往伊利沙伯醫院治理，案件列交通意外有人受傷。現場消息稱，涉事囚車右前胎爆裂，其後由拖車拖走。</p><figure><img alt=\"囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161999817916813312657109.jpeg/5Ba7RgKY8UioW-uy-AivqJ9Hgok5j3vcVeiCz1Xogs8\"/><figcaption>囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161999820458692608458713.jpeg/h9bczPDAbtaZq6BFAqGk_RYArSIQJHROl2hpiJdoaYg\"/><figcaption>囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161999823105429504403865.jpeg/z02eWMLcJzGVzwmcKnREVYohaxszwBCd5eaOyeXmjsk\"/><figcaption>囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161999826326786048076349.jpeg/251Zkt6X00ZvH8fwl3cxHHH7xcvGJ2no8eVlp_HlZac\"/><figcaption>囚車右前胎爆胎，事後被拖出管道。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事囚車由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161997904245035008417260.jpeg/DQu81XPx7e3wLDFIR5K6V72sdcBPykTgyhSN2MoUjdg\"/><figcaption>涉事囚車由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事囚車由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161997901942231040509236.jpeg/4_9w4fkzcp_PqxBEvyzUZCoLydUI5czR6p1gU-qdYFM\"/><figcaption>涉事囚車由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事囚車由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161997899366797312829073.jpeg/llZ7sn62qHpDaS5glYRy0UGayqnurE1xeEGo_3hBqP8\"/><figcaption>涉事囚車由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事囚車由拖車拖走。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1161997897072381952038691.jpeg/YgNG15aNATZjhhLitbhGZaktjOoQ9Ymg6PmjA-j5owM\"/><figcaption>涉事囚車由拖車拖走。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-06T03:59:54.887944+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}